extends layout

block content
  section.page
    .content-surface
      h1.section-title What I Do

      p.page-intro
        | Most software has three layers: the screens you see, the engine behind them that
        | stores and moves information, and the setup that keeps it all online. I work across
        | all three &mdash; that&rsquo;s what &ldquo;full-stack&rdquo; means &mdash; so one
        | person can take your idea from sketch to launch.

      .skill-group
        h2.group-title Frontend
        p.group-desc The part you see and click &mdash; websites, dashboards and apps.
        ul.tick-list
          li Clean, easy-to-use screens that work on phones, tablets and desktops
          li Pages that load quickly, even on a patchy mobile connection
          li Interactive tools like forms, quote builders, dashboards and booking flows
        .tech-stack(aria-label="Tools")
          span.tag TypeScript
          span.tag HTML &amp; CSS
          span.tag React
          span.tag Next.js
          span.tag Responsive Design
          span.tag Web Performance

      .skill-group
        h2.group-title Backend
        p.group-desc The engine behind the screens &mdash; where information is stored, processed and kept safe.
        ul.tick-list
          li Databases that keep customer, sales and stock records organised
          li Secure logins, so the right people see the right information
          li Connecting your systems so they talk to each other &mdash; website, CRM, WhatsApp, phones
          li Background automations, so nobody has to copy and paste between apps
        .tech-stack(aria-label="Tools")
          span.tag TypeScript
          span.tag Python
          span.tag Node.js
          span.tag NestJS
          span.tag FastAPI
          span.tag PostgreSQL
          span.tag Redis
          span.tag SQLite
          span.tag MSSQL
          span.tag APIs
          span.tag Event Queues

      .skill-group
        h2.group-title Infrastructure
        p.group-desc Getting software online, and keeping it there.
        ul.tick-list
          li Cloud hosting, so your app is up 24/7 &mdash; load shedding or not
          li Automatic testing, so new changes don&rsquo;t break what already works
          li Safe, repeatable releases &mdash; updates go out in minutes, not with crossed fingers
        .tech-stack(aria-label="Tools")
          span.tag Docker
          span.tag CI/CD
          span.tag AWS
          span.tag GCP
          span.tag Fly.io
          span.tag GitHub Actions
          span.tag Playwright
          span.tag Jest

      .skill-group
        h2.group-title Specialisations
        p.group-desc Where I go deep.
        ul.tick-list
          li
            strong AI assistants.
            |  Chat assistants that answer questions using your own business data, and
            | automations that take repetitive work off your team&rsquo;s plate. Think
            | ChatGPT, but plugged into your systems and following your rules.
          li
            strong Odoo.
            |  All-in-one business software that runs sales, invoicing, stock and customer
            | records in one place. I set it up, tailor it to how you work, and connect it to
            | everything else you use.
          li
            strong Software that grows with you.
            |  Systems designed to stay fast as you go from ten users to ten thousand, and
            | that keep running even when one part has a bad day.
        .tech-stack(aria-label="Tools")
          span.tag AI Agents &amp; LLMs
          span.tag Odoo
          span.tag Distributed Systems
          span.tag Architecture
          span.tag Performance &amp; Scale
